    "bio": "a Representative from Pennsylvania; born in Swissvale, Allegheny County, Pa., August 5, 1953; graduated from Swissvale Area High School, Swissvale, Pa., 1971; B.S., Pennsylvania State University, University Park, Pa., 1975; member of the Swissvale, Pa., borough council, 1977-1981; staff, Pennsylvania state senator Frank Pecora, 1979-1994; elected as a Democrat to the One Hundred Fourth and to the thirteen succeeding Congresses until his resignation on December 31, 2022 (January 3, 1995-December 31, 2022); was not a candidate for reelection to the One Hundred Eighteenth Congress in 2022.",
